---
// src/components/Manifesto.astro
---
<section class="reveal mt-32 md:mt-48 mb-24 md:mb-32 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto relative group">
    <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#facc15]/10 to-transparent blur-2xl opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-1000 -z-10 rounded-[3rem]"></div>

    <div class="relative bg-[#111111]/80 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 rounded-[2rem] p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
        
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 sm:w-40 sm:h-40 bg-[#facc15]/5 rounded-bl-full pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 sm:top-8 sm:right-8 text-white/10 font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-widest pointer-events-none">+ + +</div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 sm:bottom-8 sm:left-8 text-white/5 font-mono text-[8px] tracking-[0.5em] pointer-events-none transform -rotate-90 origin-left">SYS.BOOT</div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-10 md:gap-16 items-center relative z-10">
            
            <div class="flex-1 w-full">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 mb-6 sm:mb-8">
                    <span class="w-8 sm:w-12 h-[2px] bg-[#facc15]"></span>
                    <h2 class="text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] sm:tracking-[0.4em] text-[#facc15]">
                        Nuestra misión
                    </h2>
                </div>
                
                <h3 class="text-[1.75rem] leading-[1.1] sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black italic uppercase text-white break-words">
                    Digitalizando <br/>
                    <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#facc15] to-[#facc15]/60 block mt-1 sm:mt-2">
                        el comercio
                    </span>
                    <span class="text-transparent block mt-1 sm:mt-2" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);">
                        rural.
                    </span>
                </h3>
            </div>

            <div class="flex-1 bg-black/60 p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 relative mt-4 lg:mt-0">
                <div class="absolute -top-[1px] -left-[1px] w-5 h-5 sm:w-6 sm:h-6 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-[#facc15]"></div>
                <div class="absolute -bottom-[1px] -right-[1px] w-5 h-5 sm:w-6 sm:h-6 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-[#facc15]/30"></div>

                <div class="space-y-5 sm:space-y-6">
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        <strong class="text-white">Hackeamos la cadena de suministro tradicional.</strong> En LocalMarket, no solo distribuimos productos, conectamos la producción artesanal del mundo rural con el pulso urbano.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Nuestro protocolo es simple: <span class="text-[#facc15] font-bold">KM 0 real</span>, trazabilidad absoluta y una arquitectura tecnológica que permite que Villanueva Mesía se convierta en el nuevo centro neurálgico del e-commerce.
                    </p>
                    
                    <div class="pt-2 sm:pt-4">
                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-[#facc15]/10 rounded-lg border border-[#facc15]/20">
                            <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
                                <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#facc15] opacity-75"></span>
                                <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-[#facc15]"></span>
                            </span>
                            <span class="text-[#facc15] text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
                                Status: Operativo
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>